PARTIAL DERIVATION NOTICE

The wavefront-alignment kernels in include/genoaligner/backend/ are a
transcription of the published WFA formulation, taken from the reference
implementation:

    github.com/smarco/WFA
    Copyright (c) 2017 Santiago Marco-Sola
    MIT License

Specifically, the offset macros (WAVEFRONT_H / WAVEFRONT_V /
WAVEFRONT_OFFSET_NULL), the compute-next step (wavefront_compute_edit_idm) and
the traceback walk are ported from that source, with the source file and line
cited in the comments at each site. The MIT terms of the original apply to
those portions, and its copyright notice is reproduced above.

Everything else in this repository (the HIP portability layer, the parity and
benchmark harnesses, the public API, the tests and the documentation) is
original work by the copyright holder above.

